.TH XMFONTDIALOG 3 2026-08-29 "Motif 2.5.3"
.SH NAME
XmFontDialog - Font Selection Dialog

.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <Xm/FontDialog.h>
.fi

.SH DESCRIPTION
Allows a user to easily select a font from available Xft or X fonts by
foundry and family, style, and point size. The available options are
displayed in three scrolled lists: font, style, and size; which cascade
in that order as the selected options change. The sample string is
displayed in a frame below the lists, rendered in the currently selected
font.

.SH CLASSES
\fBXmFontDialog\fP inherits behaviors, resources, and traits from
\fBXmBulletinBoard\fP and its superclasses.

Its class pointer is \fBxmFontDialogWidgetClass\fP.

.SH WIDGETS
